    "title": "Verwendung von Objektmethoden",
    "descriptionContent": "Lerne, wie du mit Eigenschaften interagierst und reale Verhaltensweisen durch Methoden darstellst.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17521,
        "title": "Objektmethoden",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148590,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Manchmal haben wir Funktionen, die eng mit unseren Spielobjekten verbunden sind. Wie eine <code>jump()</code>-Funktion, die mit einem <code>player</code>-Objekt verbunden ist.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;player jumps!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jump();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>jump</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148591,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ähnlich wie Eigenschaften können wir verwandte Funktionen in Objekte gruppieren. Funktionen innerhalb eines Objekts werden als <strong>Methoden</strong> des Objekts bezeichnet.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>jump : function() {}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148592,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir erstellen Objektmethoden wie Eigenschaften, beginnend mit einem Namen und einem Doppelpunkt <code>:</code>, gefolgt vom Schlüsselwort <code>function</code>, <code>()</code> und geschweiften Klammern <code>{}</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>function</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148593,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir rufen diese Methoden mit dem Objektnamen, einem <code>.</code> und dem Methodennamen gefolgt von Klammern <code>()</code> auf, wie <code>player.jump();</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;player jumps!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.jump();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>player</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>jump</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148594,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Methoden sind ähnlich wie normale Funktionen. Das bedeutet, dass wir auch Parameter und <code>return</code>-Anweisungen einfügen können.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"scoreMessage\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score +&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.scoreMessage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>function(points)</code>, gefolgt von <code>return</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148595,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie nennen wir Funktionen innerhalb eines Objekts?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die Methoden des Objekts</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Funktionen des Objekts</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die Methoden des Objekts.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148596,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setze den Code zusammen, um die Methode des Objekts zu erstellen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"62\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>attack</code>, gefolgt von <code>:</code> und schließlich <code>function</code>, <code>()</code>, <code>{}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148597,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie würden wir dem <code>enemy</code>-Objekt sagen, die <code>attack</code>-Methode auszuführen?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime attacks!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>enemy.attack()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>enemy.attack</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>enemy.attack()</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148598,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fülle das fehlende Schlüsselwort aus, um eine Methode zu erstellen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"60\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>function</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148599,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welches Schlüsselwort verwenden wir, um eine Methode zu definieren?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>function</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>method</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>function</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148600,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setze den Code zusammen, um die Methode <code>attack</code> des <code>enemy</code>-Objekts aufzurufen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"call\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime attacks!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.attack();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>enemy</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>attack</code>, <code>()</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148601,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Können Methoden Parameter und <code>return</code>-Anweisungen verwenden?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ja</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nein</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Ja aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148602,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge den fehlenden Parameter zur Methode hinzu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Slime\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"takeDamage\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"damageAmount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Damage taken: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + damageAmount);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>damageAmount</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17522,
        "title": "Methoden verwenden",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148603,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lass uns lernen, wie man Methoden verwendet, um auf die Eigenschaften unseres Objekts zuzugreifen und sie zu aktualisieren.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.display();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>player.display();</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148604,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Das Schlüsselwort <code>this</code> bezieht sich auf das Objekt, das die Methode enthält. In diesem Fall <code>player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.display();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>this</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148605,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können <code>this</code> gefolgt von einem <code>.</code> verwenden, um die Eigenschaften des Objekts von innerhalb seiner Methoden zu erhalten.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.display();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>this</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>name</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148606,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ähnlich können wir <code>this</code> gefolgt von einem <code>.</code> verwenden, um die Eigenschaften des Objekts von innerhalb seiner Methoden zu aktualisieren.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"changeAndDisplay\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.changeAndDisplay();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>this.name</code>, gefolgt von <code>=</code> und schließlich <code>\"Knight\"</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148607,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Das Schlüsselwort <code>this</code> kann nur verwendet werden, um auf die Eigenschaften eines Objekts <strong>innerhalb</strong> der Methode des Objekts zuzugreifen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"126\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"changeAndDisplay\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.changeAndDisplay();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>this</code>, gefolgt von <code>this</code> und schließlich <code>player</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148608,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welches Schlüsselwort können wir verwenden, um auf das Objekt zu verweisen, das die Methode enthält?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>that</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>this</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148609,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ordne den Code so an, dass der <code>name</code> des Spielerobjekts geändert wird, bevor er angezeigt wird.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.display();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>this</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>name</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"Ranger\"</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
